---
import MarketingLayout from '../../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
import { getBrand } from '../../lib/brand';

const brand = getBrand();
---

<MarketingLayout title="我的服务" description="查询和续费我的服务">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10">
    <section class="rounded-3xl bg-[var(--brand-surface)] p-6 ring-1 ring-slate-200 md:p-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--brand-text)]">我的服务</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
        脚手架阶段先保留页面入口。完整查询、续费、邀请码与重启逻辑将从现网
        <code>pages/my-service/index.html</code> 迁入 React 组件。
      </p>
      <label class="mt-6 block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700" for="service_name">服务地址</label>
      <input
        id="service_name"
        class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2"
        placeholder="示例: device1.xxxxxxxx.adguardprivate.com"
      />
      <button class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-[var(--brand-primary)] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white" type="button">
        立即查询
      </button>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500">API Base: {brand.apiBase}</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</MarketingLayout>
